{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっほぉおおにぎり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は1人で買い物に行きました( ´ ▽ ` )ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"原宿いったらオダナナとミナミに会ったよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1回ばいばいして分かれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけどね何かソファーに親子が座ってるな〜って思ってたらオダナナとミナミだった(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近オダナナ、ママにしか見えないわ!ややこしいわ!\n最近オダナナいじりまくってるわ!せやねん!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミナミに発音違うって怒られる〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも関西弁かわいいから話してみたいねん。\n文にすると発音とかないから関西弁に見えてくるねん。\n関西弁かわぇぇなぁ〜。ミナミに関西弁ちゃんとならわへんとなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せやねんなぁ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はね、1人で駄菓子屋さんに行ったよ(*^。^*)\n駄菓子屋さんは大きくなっても好きだ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、1人でうどん食べたよ(*^。^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もたくさん歩いたぜぇえ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHESZEFH7KYJNXTT3HT5HEED","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らいおん。ぎゃぁおおお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイアム寅年"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"志田愛佳"}],"source":"archive"}